[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17776.868, "timestamp": "04:56:16", "text": "萬點傷害。哦，天哪。還有，DJ，你最近也抽到了孩子。所以，是的。哦，不錯。不錯。對了，我在吃巧克力曲奇。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17791.11, "timestamp": "04:56:31", "text": "你知道捉迷藏嗎？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17794.23, "timestamp": "04:56:34", "text": "哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17797.51, "timestamp": "04:56:37", "text": "，知道。你知道捉迷藏"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17802.31, "timestamp": "04:56:42", "text": "曲奇嗎？是啊，是啊，是啊，是啊"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17806.708, "timestamp": "04:56:46", "text": "。我終於買到它們了。嗯哼。它們真是太好吃了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17813.27, "timestamp": "04:56:53", "text": "。我好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17818.868, "timestamp": "04:56:58", "text": "享受啊。"}]